values.content:
Write a competitive battle card.

Our product: {{ $json.input.yourProductName }}
Description: {{ $json.input.yourProductDescription || 'not provided' }}
Competitor: {{ $json.input.competitorName }}
Competitor description: {{ $json.input.competitorDescription || 'not provided' }}
Target persona: {{ $json.input.targetPersona || 'not specified' }}
Pricing context: {{ $json.input.pricingContext || 'not specified' }}

Our known strengths vs this competitor:
{{ $json.input.yourStrengths.join('\n') || 'not specified — derive from descriptions' }}

Known competitor weaknesses:
{{ $json.input.knownWeaknesses.join('\n') || 'not specified — derive from research' }}

Common objections when competing:
{{ $json.input.commonObjections.join('\n') || 'not specified' }}

Win/loss context:
{{ $json.input.winLossContext || 'not provided' }}

Public competitor research:
{{ $json.competitorContext }}

Return JSON:
{"competitor_overview":"2-3 sentences: who they are, who buys them, and why — honest assessment","where_we_win":[{"scenario":"deal situation where we have advantage","why":"specific reason","talk_track":"what to say"}],"where_they_win":[{"scenario":"deal situation where they have advantage","why":"honest reason","mitigation":"how to respond or reframe"}],"feature_comparison":[{"dimension":"capability area","us":"","them":"","advantage":"us|them|tied"}],"objection_responses":[{"objection":"what the prospect says","avoid":"what not to say","response":"what to say instead — specific, not generic"}],"landmines":["questions to ask that surface competitor weaknesses naturally"],"traps_to_avoid":["things reps often say that backfire in this competitive situation"],"displacement_play":"if they are already using the competitor, what's the best angle to displace","qualification_signals":["signs this deal favors us"],"disqualification_signals":["signs this deal will be hard to win — consider walking away"]}
